      "text": "strategy portfolio numbers again to show them the highest losing trade and tell them it because of rule based trading\nwe can earn more than market if one of our stocks goes down more. that kind of movement does happen rarely, and it only happens rarely so it doesnt matter if we stick to our rules\nshow them some of our trades where a stocks was down 20-40 % but closed in profit if we had stuck to our strategy.\n",
