      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793810096785,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "if stocks go down this much and still turn up profit than why dont we buy\nthem later and cheaper? cuz more than 70-75% of our stocks dont go down\nmore than 3-5% after we entry.",
      "fontSize": 20,
